1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,329
Before a shopping agent spends your money, what would its plan actually do?

2
00:00:05,329 --> 00:00:07,988
Rehearsal measures the impact first.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:14,750
We leave for our first family camping trip on Saturday. One tent, two lanterns, at

4
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:20,624
home by Friday evening. Two hundred dollars, including shipping. Let’s rehearse

5
00:00:20,624 --> 00:00:21,878
before ordering.

6
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:32,212
This is the deployed dashboard in Google Chrome. Amazon Nova 2 Lite proposes a

7
00:00:32,212 --> 00:00:40,084
plan. Three supplier plans are tested in twelve isolated runs. No external order or

8
00:00:40,084 --> 00:00:41,825
payment is created.

9
00:00:43,033 --> 00:00:49,337
Nova initially proposed supplier A: one hundred forty-nine dollars. But A meets

10
00:00:49,337 --> 00:00:55,688
only two of the four tested conditions. B costs thirty dollars more and meets all

11
00:00:55,688 --> 00:01:00,727
four. The cheapest option, C, arrives after the trip.

12
00:01:02,033 --> 00:01:09,371
The report keeps every result visible. If A loses stock or raises its price, its

13
00:01:09,371 --> 00:01:16,255
purchase is blocked. The matrix shows spending and unresolved reservations. These

14
00:01:16,255 --> 00:01:21,398
counts describe this test set, not real-world success probabilities.

15
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:30,309
Here, a simulated payment commits and its reply is hidden. Rehearsal retains the

16
00:01:30,309 --> 00:01:36,439
reservation and queries the same order. It confirms the payment without creating

17
00:01:36,439 --> 00:01:43,916
another one. The verified result is one complete basket and zero duplicate payments.

18
00:01:45,133 --> 00:01:52,703
Now I accept plan B for review. The server rechecks the source and report expiry,

19
00:01:52,703 --> 00:01:59,599
then records a brief bound to this exact plan. I can download it. This is execution

20
00:01:59,599 --> 00:02:03,848
evidence, not a purchase or payment authorization.

21
00:02:05,067 --> 00:02:11,093
Reloading restores the decision. The evidence includes source and report hashes,

22
00:02:11,093 --> 00:02:17,548
raw journals and model usage. The limits remain visible: a synthetic catalog,

23
00:02:17,548 --> 00:02:22,714
simulated delivery, and stock and price shocks aimed only at A.

24
00:02:23,933 --> 00:02:31,468
AgentCore and Nova run on demand. A separate Lambda verifies the evidence and stops

25
00:02:31,468 --> 00:02:38,829
the preview session. Its IAM role cannot invoke commerce tools. Storage and service

26
00:02:38,829 --> 00:02:41,023
requests remain metered.

27
00:02:42,233 --> 00:02:48,026
Rehearsal turns an agent’s plan into inspectable evidence, before it affects a real

28
00:02:48,026 --> 00:02:52,218
transaction. Plan. Measure. Decide.
